  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A programme of work developing new vaccines, therapeutics and private sector driven supply chains to make these, and other essential animal health products, widely available to small-scale farmers throughout Africa. Additionally, undertaking targeted disease surveillance work of the major poultry diseases impacting farmers in Africa.</narrative>
